{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape your clone squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mix traits, weapons, and armor \u2014 everything changes how your clones behave and look</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/10b8b26c28ba7615e3d15504e660a4d1.poster.avif?t=1760031315\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/10b8b26c28ba7615e3d15504e660a4d1.webm?t=1760031315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/10b8b26c28ba7615e3d15504e660a4d1.mp4?t=1760031315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>You\u2019ll battle across multiple worlds</strong> \u2014 from frozen wastes to hellish rifts and glowing voids \u2014 each fight unfolding in turn-based combat on a tight two-row battlefield.<br>\u00a0As you conquer new realms, you\u2019ll unlock rarer, more powerful cards \u2014 but enemies grow deadlier too. Choose next invasion wisely. Adapt your deck with every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Design tactical combos that might dominate one world</strong> \u2014 but fall apart in another.<br>Draft gear cards to define your clones:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you deploy a stealthy ninja in light armor with a sword?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or a reckless caster who summons a black hole that consumes everything \u2014 enemies, allies\u2026 and himself?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Or don't equip your clones, and instead choose one who will absorb all the damage meant for your team, unleashing it in a single powerful superstrike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/a407d8f9b4d2c0f26630f8ceb38dae76.poster.avif?t=1760031315\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/a407d8f9b4d2c0f26630f8ceb38dae76.webm?t=1760031315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/a407d8f9b4d2c0f26630f8ceb38dae76.mp4?t=1760031315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the rightful master of the worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And these ignorant, narrow-minded creatures?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They don\u2019t understand the glory of your rule.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of course they resist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>World domination? Please...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Worlds domination \u2014 that\u2019s more like it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The right strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The right portals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The right new order.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is how it begins!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918840?t=1760031315","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918840?t=1760031315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/2f94a28db81b17074cd6193625eece3833f11b9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760031315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/2f94a28db81b17074cd6193625eece3833f11b9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760031315","categories":[